1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,235
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,235 --> 00:00:02,103
I'm Mimzi,

3
00:00:02,103 --> 00:00:03,506
and this is Teddy!

4
00:00:04,056 --> 00:00:05,306
I'm hungry!

5
00:00:05,856 --> 00:00:08,698
Let's learn healthy vegetables!

6
00:00:10,048 --> 00:00:12,001
This is a carrot.

7
00:00:12,401 --> 00:00:14,860
Carrot! Can you say carrot?

8
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:18,594
It is orange and crunchy.

9
00:00:19,944 --> 00:00:22,158
This is a potato.

10
00:00:22,558 --> 00:00:25,260
Potato! Can you say potato?

11
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:29,493
It is brown and grows in the ground.

12
00:00:30,843 --> 00:00:32,581
What is this?

13
00:00:34,381 --> 00:00:35,712
Tomato!

14
00:00:36,262 --> 00:00:38,381
It is red and round.

15
00:00:38,931 --> 00:00:40,362
Yum, yum!

16
00:00:41,712 --> 00:00:43,807
This is a broccoli.

17
00:00:44,207 --> 00:00:47,070
Broccoli! Can you say broccoli?

18
00:00:48,470 --> 00:00:50,684
It looks like a little tree!

19
00:00:52,034 --> 00:00:53,987
This is a corn.

20
00:00:54,387 --> 00:00:56,766
Corn! Can you say corn?

21
00:00:58,166 --> 00:01:00,356
It is yellow and sweet.

22
00:01:01,706 --> 00:01:03,444
What is this?

23
00:01:05,244 --> 00:01:06,353
Peas!

24
00:01:06,903 --> 00:01:08,293
They are small,

25
00:01:08,293 --> 00:01:09,760
round and green.

26
00:01:10,310 --> 00:01:11,742
Yum, yum!

27
00:01:13,092 --> 00:01:16,217
Vegetables make us big and strong!

28
00:01:16,767 --> 00:01:19,005
Great job, little learner!

29
00:01:19,555 --> 00:01:21,443
Share Mimzi with a friend,

30
00:01:21,443 --> 00:01:23,983
and subscribe for more learning fun!

31
00:01:24,533 --> 00:01:25,464
Next time,

32
00:01:25,464 --> 00:01:27,900
let's sing a good morning song.

33
00:01:28,150 --> 00:01:29,521
Bye bye!
